      }
    },
    "391": {
      "date": "2026-11-15",
      "edition": "Sunday 15 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Emotional scenes",
          "heading": "Alex Cuthbert left speechless on BBC commentary as Wales beat All Blacks",
          "body": "Former Wales wing Alex Cuthbert could barely contain himself at the final whistle in Cardiff, his emotion captured on BBC Radio 5 Live's footage from the commentary box. Commentator Sara Orchard had called it as the whistle blew: \"This is it, this is the moment.\" Then Cuthbert, his voice broken, said: \"Oh my God, I don't know what to say. Wow, what?! Just unbelievable.\" Wales had earned it: 73 years and 34 consecutive defeats to New Zealand ended in a 35-28 win."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "England thrash Japan 78-15 as Will Joseph equals try record",
          "body": "Italy fall 19-14 to Argentina after Garbisi's late error. France's Julien Marchand ruled out for rest of Nations Championship. Australia restore Carter Gordon to starting XV after broken leg."
        }
      ],
      "source": {
